example.value:
Example showing how to specify the value of a physical quantity in turtle using hasSIQuantityValue:

    height1 a emmo:Height ;
        hasSIQuantityValue "3 cm"^^emmo:SIQuantityDatatype .

This relation can be used to relate a material to a chemical composition quantity of one of its chemical species. For example, the amount of aluminium in substance subst:alloy1 can be expressed as:

```turtle
subst:alloy1 a emmo:Substance ;
    emmo:hasChemicalComposition [
        a emmo:SingleComponentComposition ;
        emmo:hasSpeciesPart [ a emmo:AluminiumSymbol ] ;
        emmo:hasQuantityPart [
            a emmo:MassFraction ;
            hasSIQuantityValue "98.1 wt%"^^emmo:SIQuantityDatatype
        ]
    ] .
```
